text.paragraph:
                     8.6 Renal Impairment


No dose adjustment is necessary in patients with estimated glomerular filtration rate (eGFR) ≥30 mL/min [see

                        Clinical Pharmacology (12.3)
                     ]. Avoid use of BESREMi in patients with eGFR <30 mL/min [see 

                        Warnings and Precautions (5.12)
                     ].
